WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.912
Hi, I'm Snap. I'm the Avatar Builder.

00:00:05.062 --> 00:00:09.742
I make your avatar, the picture of you on your plugin page.

00:00:09.892 --> 00:00:14.692
Upload a photo, or tell me what to make and I'll generate one for you.

00:00:14.842 --> 00:00:21.970
For example, upload one photo, pick Anime, Cartoon, or Realistic, and I make it for you.
